# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, this matched *any* directory
# named `data` at any depth — including src/trade_agent/data/, the package
# holding the snapshot builder and the indicators. Those four files were never
# committed, so every clone built a Lambda artifact without them and every
# function died on import.
